sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M1 as Mentor A
  actor M2 as Mentor B
  participant A as Express /api
  participant B as BountyService
  participant R as BountyRepo
  participant RR as RoomRepo
  participant N as Notifier
  actor S as Student
  par both click Accept
    M1->>A: POST /bounties/:id/accept
  and
    M2->>A: POST /bounties/:id/accept
  end
  A->>B: acceptBounty(A)
  B->>R: claim(id, A, now)
  Note over R: findOneAndUpdate({_id, status:"open", expiresAt>now})<br/>→ only ONE update can match
  R-->>B: bounty (accepted by A)
  B->>RR: create(room, participants, expiresAt = now + sessionMinutes)
  B->>R: setRoom(id, roomId)
  B->>N: toUsers([student], "bounty:accepted")
  N-->>S: bounty:accepted {roomId}
  B->>N: toRole("mentor", "bounty:taken")
  A-->>M1: 200 {bounty, room}
  A->>B: acceptBounty(B)
  B->>R: claim(id, B, now)
  R-->>B: null
  B-->>A: 409 Conflict
  A-->>M2: 409 already taken
